# Project Name: Off-Campus Tracker

# What are you building?:	An off-campus working hours calculator, and bill tracker

# Minimum Viable Product (MVP):	Takes in the wage and the rent costs, and calculates how many hours you need to work to afford it.

# Stretch Goals:	Takes in grocery, utility, and amenity costs as well, and includes those in the calculations.

# Behavior / recovery from bad input:	Gives them a gentle message to try again (with simple instructions).
# Incrementally asks for the numbers, catching user errors along the way and gently guiding them.

# What you don't know:	Nothing... we just need to store the values as variables, and add them into the final calculation.
# Also need to print the messages into the console for the user.
